sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Student (Flutter App)
    participant Camera as Mobile Scanner
    participant Express as Express REST API
    participant MongoDB as MongoDB Atlas Cloud
    actor Admin as Admin (React Portal)
    actor Staff as Maintenance Staff

    Student->>Camera: Point camera at Classroom QR Code
    Camera-->>Student: QR Code Detected: "PU-ENGG-LH204"
    Student->>Express: GET /api/locations/qr/PU-ENGG-LH204
    Express->>MongoDB: Query Location details
    MongoDB-->>Express: Return Room Details (Block A, LH-204, Projector...)
    Express-->>Student: Return 200 OK + Location Payload

    Student->>Student: Select Category: "Projector Problem"
    Student->>Student: Add Description + Take Photo
    Student->>Express: POST /api/complaints (multipart/form-data)
    Express->>MongoDB: Insert Complaint (Status: Pending) + ComplaintHistory
    MongoDB-->>Express: Confirmed with Ticket #CMP-2026-0042
    Express-->>Student: Return 201 Created + Ticket Summary

    Admin->>Express: GET /api/complaints?status=Pending
    Express->>MongoDB: Fetch pending complaints
    MongoDB-->>Express: Return Complaints list
    Express-->>Admin: Renders in React Admin Dashboard
    Admin->>Express: PUT /api/complaints/:id/assign (Assign to Technician)
    Express->>MongoDB: Update Status: Assigned, Append History, Create Notification
    
    Student->>Express: GET /api/complaints/my (Pull-to-refresh)
    Express->>MongoDB: Fetch Student's Complaints
    MongoDB-->>Express: Return updated records
    Express-->>Student: Display Status: "Assigned"

    Staff-->>Admin: Fixes projector on-site
    Admin->>Express: PUT /api/complaints/:id/status (Status: "Resolved")
    Express->>MongoDB: Update Status: Resolved, Log Resolution Time
    Student->>Student: Receives in-app Notification: "Issue Resolved"

